  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1005.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1005.01 Purpose. Subdivision rules are to assure to the greatest extent possible that each lot in a subdivision or the property on which a condominium is proposed can sustain on-site sewage disposal indefinitely so that the purposes expressed in RSA 485-A:1 and Env-Wq 1001.01 can be achieved and smart growth can be encouraged, pursuant to RSA 9-B:3.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1000.html"
}
